SUMMARY:GTApreneurs Sept. 16-2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking Ev
 ent Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nDo you want
  more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs September 17-2026 Afternoon Virtual
  Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing entrepreneurs\, l
 earn something new and promote your business!\n\n\\*\\*You need to registe
 r on our website to attend this event and get the link. RSVPing on Meetup 
 does not mean that you are registered\, even though Meetup.com will send y
 ou an email saying that you have. Thank you. Please go here: https://gtapr
 eneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\n\n\\*Please note this event is adver
 tised on multiple platforms\, and we expect around 20-25 guests.\n\nThis e
 vent will feature Guest Speaker **Allan Pollett**\, SEO Guru & CEO\, Globa
 l Net Trade. Since 1998\, Allan has been working as a SEO and web marketin
 g specialist. He is known as the "SEO Guru" having written several books o
 n reputation management\, social media and SEO related topics. Over the ye
 ars\, he has helped over a 1000 businesses get to the top of the organic s
 earch results. One of his most recent achievements is helping one of his c
 lients generate enough revenue from their YouTube channel to buy a Lamborg
 hini.\n\nLearn more about **Allan** here: www.AllanPollett.com\n\n**WARM-U
 P ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* **12:00-12
 :10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:** Featured
  Presentation: Allan Pollett\, ***"In the AI age\, are SEO and paid ads de
 ad?"***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\nFree\n\n*
 *PREMIUM EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\
 n* **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30p
 m:** Featured Presentation: Allan Pollett\, ***"In the AI age\, are SEO an
 d paid ads dead?"***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds eac
 h)\n* **1:00-2:00pm:** Breakout rooms (Network 1-1 with other guests)\n\n*
 *TICKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking 
 Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $10\n\\*Premium ticket includes Guest Co
 ntact sheet emailed to you after the event. Note: You must attend the even
 t to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\n**Event Organizer & Host:**\n**Ta
 mmy Defoe**\, President and Business Coach\, GTApreneurs\nVisit https://gt
 apreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto 
 for more information about Tammy and her Business Coaching and Consulting 
 services.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nContact Tammy at (416) 522-77
 70 or info@gtapreneurs.com or book a video consultation with her here: htt
 ps://calendly.com/gtapreneurs\n\nWant to attend the Premium version of our
  Virtual Networking Events for FREE? Become a Member. Learn more at https:
 //gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
