SUMMARY:GTApreneurs' September 17\, 2026 Speed Business Networking Event i
 n Pickering
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  an exciting Business Networking Event at The Fox Goes Free pub on Thursda
 y Sept 17\, 2026 where you can mix n mingle with other friendly entreprene
 urs and small business owners and engage in 3-minute intervals of Speed Ne
 tworking! This is an outstanding opportunity for you to meet potential cli
 ents and referral partners and promote your business.\n\n***Appetizers pro
 vided. \\*Cash bar.***\n\nThis is casual\, social networking event where y
 ou can stand or sit to connect with new people or with familiar faces. We 
 will start with ice breakers to ease into the open networking. We will pro
 vide you with a Guest Contact Sheet by 5pm the day after the day\, but\, b
 ring your business cards to share too. It will help those you meet to reme
 mber you.\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networkin
 g-events-pickering\n\n* **TIME:** 6:00-8:00pm\n* **VENUE:** The Fox Goes F
 ree\n* **ADDRESS:** 339 Kingston Rd\, Pickering\, ON L1V 1A1\n* **PARKING:
 ** Free\, onsite\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networ
 king + appetizers + buy your own beverage\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** 1-1 Speed ne
 tworking – 3 minutes/table then rotate\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs
 ' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-
 members:** $22 in advance or $25 on event day\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVE
 NT?**\nCall or text **Yolande** at 705-710-9026 or email mmlf-info@consult
 ant.com\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships and r
 egister: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
