SUMMARY:GTApreneurs BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference – VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nYou are inv
 ited to an exciting mega networking bash! Join us on **Tuesday\, October 2
 0\, 2026** for **GTApreneurs’** **BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference
 !** We expect 300+ small business owners and entrepreneurs all looking to 
 meet you and many others to do business together!\n\n**REGISTER HERE** \\>
 \\> [https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx-business-expo-toronto](https://gtapreneu
 rs.com/bizx-business-expo-toronto)\n\n**VENUE:** Hazelton Manor\n**ADDRESS
 :** 99 Peelar Rd\, Vaughan\, ON\n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite\n\n**VIP Ticke
 t Itinerary:**\n\n* **9:00-10:30am:** CONTINENTAL BREAKFAST and Open Netwo
 rking + visit Lobby & Conference Room Exhibitors\n* **10:30-10:45am:** GTA
 preneurs welcoming presentation\n* **10:45-11:00am:** Platinum and Gold Sp
 onsor Introductions\n* **11:00-11:20am:** **Nile Saïd** presentation\, **
 *"Your Business Has A Tell"***\n* **11:20-11:40am:** **Angie Nezarati** pr
 esentation\, ***“Your income works\, your capital doesn’t – yet”**
 *\n* **11:40-12:00pm: Muhammad Murtaza Khan** presentation\, ***“Stop Gu
 essing\, Start Growing: The Strategic Power of Cash Flow Forecasting.”**
 *\n* **12:15- 2:00pm:** VIP Lunch\n* **1:00-4:30pm:** BizX 2026 Business E
 xpo (Main expo room)\n* **2:30-2:50pm:** **Bruno Teixeira** presentation\,
  ***"Where does AI actually save you hours?”***\n* **2:50-3:10pm:** **He
 len Ching** presentation\, ***“Early bird gets the worm. Early planning 
 accumulates significant business wealth.”***\n* **4:30-5:00pm:** *Awards
  Ceremony:* ***Draw and awards*** given for **door prizes\, BizX 2026 Expo
  Contest and Exhibitor Draw**\n\n\\*\\*Snacks and refreshments served 1:00
 -4:30pm\n\n**VIP Ticket:**\n\n* $59 regular or $49 before August 31\, 2026
 \n* GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members: F
 ree\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/busines
 s-networking-memberships](https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memb
 erships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table at BizX 2026\,** click here >> [http
 s://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibitor](https://gtap
 reneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibitor)\n\n**Sponsor BizX 20
 26**\, send us a message >> info@gtapreneurs.com\n\n**DOOR PRIZE RAFFLE:**
  Bring your business card and drop it in the box for a chance to win a gre
 at prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO CONTEST:** Each time you visit an e
 xhibitor\, and exchange business cards (or exchange information electronic
 ally)\, they will put a sticker on your event map. Fill your map with a st
 icker from every exhibitor to win a prize. At the end of the day (4:30-5:0
 0pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest winners as well as guest door prize w
 inners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n**SPONSORED BY:**\n\n* **Sonia Kurme
 y\,** Arbonne\, [www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com](https://www.soniakurmey.arbo
 nne.com/)\n* **Balbir Pabila\,** PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, [https://bkpabila.l
 egalshieldassociate.com](https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com/)\n* **
 Michelina Dos Santos and Sonya Sokoliuk\,** The Mortgage Coach\, [https://
 themortgagecoach.ca](https://themortgagecoach.ca/)\n* **Dana Thomson\,** A
 DP\, [www.adp.com](www.adp.com)\n* **Nile Saïd\,** GoOneUp\, [https://goo
 neup.co](https://gooneup.co/)\n* **Angie Nezarati\,** Everyday Business\, 
 [https://everydaybusiness.ca](https://everydaybusiness.ca/)\n* **Muhammad 
 Khan\,** CFOs in Action\, [www.cfosinaction.com](https://www.cfosinaction.
 com/)\n* **Bruno Teixeira\,** Aegis AI & Analytics Advisory\, [https://aeg
 isaianalytics.ca](https://aegisaianalytics.ca/)\n* **Helen Ching\,** Monai
  Wealth\, [www.monaiwealth.com](https://www.monaiwealth.com/)\n\n**DISCLAI
 MERS**\n***Event Photo and Video Disclaimer:*** By registering for and/or 
 attending GTApreneurs (“Us” and “Our” and “We”) Events\, you g
 ive Us consent to use your image and/or video for Our publications\, adver
 tising and/or other media activities (including the Internet).\n\n***Infor
 mation Sharing:*** By registering for or attending a GTApreneurs networkin
 g event\, you are agreeing to share your name\, professional title\, organ
 ization name\, city\, website (if given) and LinkedIn URL (if given) with 
 the other people who attend this event. If you indicate in your registrati
 on form that you give Us permission to share your phone number and/or your
  email address with the other event attendees\, we will share the informat
 ion you give Us permission to share. If you indicate in the registration f
 orm that you don’t give Us permission to share your phone number and/or 
 your email address with the other attendees\, We will not share it with th
 e other attendees. GTApreneurs will never share your home address with any
 one.\n\n***Event Guest Contact Sheet:*** Your ticket does not include the 
 Guest or Exhibitor Contact Sheets.
